### 2.3 State Persistence & Resilient Session Resume Schemas

Real-world business workflows frequently span hours, days, or weeks. A loan application may pause for 48 hours while the applicant uploads bank statements; an SRE incident agent may wait 30 minutes for a canary deployment to bake.

Autonomous agents cannot remain resident in memory indefinitely. Active state must be serialized to durable storage (e.g., PostgreSQL, DynamoDB, or Redis) after every turn.

